<div class="center-column">
  <div class="welcome">
    <h1>Welcome</h1>
    <p>This tool allows printing paper inserts for your Keyforge decks,
      that can fit in transparent deckboxes such as "Burger Token" ones.
      Or that you can print as stickers and put them on any type or box your like</p>
    <p>
      To start testing, go to <b>"Print Insert"</b> in the top right corner
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<br/>
<div class="center-column">
  <div class="help">
    <h1>How to Export a deckList from decksofkeyforge.com (DoK)</h1>
    <p>Starting from any list of decks from Dok (premade filter like 'My Decks', or any other search)</p>
    <p>Go back in the left search column and click on the downard arrow just next to the sort options</p>
    <img src="assets/gif/exportCsv.gif" alt="how to csv export"/>
  </div>
</div>
<br/>
